  "title": "SBA Communications Corporation Reports Second Quarter 2026 Results; Updates Full Year 2026 Outlook; and Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend",
  "summary": "SBA Communications Corporation (Nasdaq: SBAC) (\"SBA\" or the \"Company\") today reported results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. Highlights of the second quarter include: Net income attributable to SBA of $198.8 million or $1.87 per share Industry-leading AFFO per share of $3.05 Issued inaugural $3.5 billion investment grade senior notes and entered into a new expanded $2.5 billion senior unsecured revolving credit facility subsequent to quarter end Ratings upgrade from SP to BBB In addit",
